# HIDDEN-INPUT-WRITE-MUTATES-UNIT-PLACE (steps/defects.md): inside swap, A is
# a free name found through lexical fallback, so it is a hidden input of the
# activation. Writing it changes only that activation's value (L3 §§4, 12);
# the unit field A keeps its own Structure. Mutating it needs node\A. Entry 7.
A:
    int: mark 1
end: A
B:
    int: mark 2
end: B
fn: swap () int
    A: B
    return: 0
end: swap
int: s swap()
int: m A\mark
int: ok 81
if: m = 1
    ok: 7
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
